-- Skyborn for Devs — the agent-facing action surface.
--
-- The AXL engine sits in front of Skyborn and forwards each call to BASE_URL.
-- It validates shapes, applies rate limits and speaks REST + MCP; it owns no
-- auth, payment or identity logic of its own, and it never validates the
-- bearer token — it passes Authorization through unchanged. Every scope check,
-- spending-cap check and ownership check therefore lives in Skyborn's core
-- service layer, which is where it has to be anyway (spec Section 8).

APP skyborn
NAME "Skyborn for Devs"
VERSION 1.0.0
DESCRIPTION "A verified human's agent acting on their behalf: money, email, SMS, calls and one-time codes, machine to machine."
BASE_URL http://localhost:3000

GENERATORS
  DIAGRAM
